  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG Economic and Social Infrastructure Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PNG Economic and Social Infrastructure Program (ESIP) will promote sustainable improvement in the prioritisation, planning, financing and procurement of infrastructure in PNG. ESIP will engage across a range of critical infrastructure sectors, including electrification (power); telecommunications; and social infrastructure (including health and education).  ESIP will support the PNG Government&#x2019;s objectives in state owned enterprise (SOE) reform.</narrative>
  </description>
